<title>USA: Global Financial, Dragon in bank pact.</title>
<headline>Global Financial, Dragon in bank pact.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Global Financial Group said Monday it entered into a one-year investment banking agreement with Dragon Environmental Corp.</p>
<p>The agreement will help Dragon arrange debt and equity financing to complete acquisitions of related industry corporations, to add additional equipment to its operations and to fund marketing efforts.</p>
<p>Dragon Environmental's patented systems remove solids and sediment from ponds, canals, rivers, water and wastewater treatment facilities.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
